<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "A food donor shall not incur any civil liability in respect of any personal injury or disease suffered by any person, or the death of any person, resulting from the consumption of the food donated or distributed by the food donor unless it can be proven that—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@> .
