<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@/~cl_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "the personal injury, disease or death was caused by the negligence or the willful misconduct of the food donor;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@/~cl_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@/~cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@> .
