<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@/~cl_3__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "the food donor has not complied with any requirement in relation to food safety and food hygiene under any written law before donating or distributing the food;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/27/eng@> .
